</div></div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><p>Kiosek poskytuje pohodlné alternativní řešení pro hosty, kteří preferují rychlý check-in/out bez návštěvy recepce. Umožněte hostům komfort, který vyžadují.</p>
</div></div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-button"><div class="center"><a class="btn btn-inverse btn-sm" href="/produkty/kiosek"><span aria-hidden="true" class="btn__icon"></span><span class="btn__label">VÍCE O PRODUKTU</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-6-12"><div class="block block-divider"><hr class="divider divider--normal divider--align-left"/></div></div> <div class="col col-7-12 grid-6-12"><div class="block block-divider"><hr class="divider divider--normal divider--align-left"/></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-6-12"><div class="block block-box box box--default box--full-height"><div class="row"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-image"><div class="flexcard flexcard-icon flexcard-none size-lg align-center"><div class="flexcard-media"><div class="image-icon-wrapper"><div class="image-icon"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/hdr-produkt-digitalni-registracni-karta.webp"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
